      "html": "<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 20px 20px 70px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 28px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M15 19.13a9.38 9.38 0 0 1 6-2.18 9.38 9.38 0 0 1 6 2.18M15 19.13v-.41c0-.86-.16-1.69-.45-2.45M15 19.13v.13a1.62 1.62 0 0 1-1.6 1.62l-.55 0c-1.05-.05-2.1-.05-3.15 0l-.55 0a1.62 1.62 0 0 1-1.6-1.62v-.13m6.85-2.86a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-2.85-1.05c-1.07 0-2.07.38-2.85 1.05m5.7 0a4.49 4.49 0 0 1 1.4 2.45m-7.1-2.45a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-1.4 2.45m2.85-7.95a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Zm6 0a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Defined male wellness audience</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Men's supplement customers are a distinct, growing audience. They buy specific products for specific outcomes, with strong loyalty to brands that deliver.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M21 8.25c0-2.49-2.02-4.5-4.5-4.5-1.83 0-3.4 1.09-4.13 2.66A4.49 4.49 0 0 0 7.5 3.75 4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3 8.25c0 6.97 9 12 9 12s9-5.03 9-12Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Multi-decade purchase pattern</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Men's health needs evolve from 20s through 60s+. One brand can serve a customer for decades across foundational, performance, prostate, and hormonal support.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 5.31-3.69 9.76-8.65 10.95a.84.84 0 0 1-.4.05.94.94 0 0 1-.41-.05A11.25 11.25 0 0 1 3 12V5.99c0-.46.31-.87.74-1.05A23.95 23.95 0 0 1 12 3a23.95 23.95 0 0 1 8.26 1.94c.43.18.74.59.74 1.05V12Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Premium pricing supported by science</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Men's wellness customers will pay for clinical-grade dosages, branded ingredients, and proven formulations.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
