      "html": "<div style=\"background: white; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Real DaVinci men's health formulations available for private label</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 48px;\">These are actual DaVinci products available for private label today. Browse the full catalog during your consultation.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M9.81 4.94 9 2.25l-.81 2.69a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 3L2.5 8.75l2.69.81a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 3 3l.81 2.69.81-2.69a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 3-3l2.69-.81-2.69-.81a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-3ZM18 7.5l-.51 1.71a3 3 0 0 1-2.03 2.03L13.75 11.75l1.71.51a3 3 0 0 1 2.03 2.03L18 16l.51-1.71a3 3 0 0 1 2.03-2.03L22.25 11.75l-1.71-.51a3 3 0 0 1-2.03-2.03L18 7.5ZM16.5 18.75 16.04 20l-.46 1.25-.46-1.25-.46-1.25.46-1.25.46 1.25Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">MULTIVITAMIN</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Daily Best\u2122 Men</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Comprehensive multivitamin with essential vitamins, minerals, amino acids and herbal extracts for men's health.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Multivitamin</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Herbals</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 5.31-3.69 9.76-8.65 10.95a.84.84 0 0 1-.4.05.94.94 0 0 1-.41-.05A11.25 11.25 0 0 1 3 12V5.99c0-.46.31-.87.74-1.05A23.95 23.95 0 0 1 12 3a23.95 23.95 0 0 1 8.26 1.94c.43.18.74.59.74 1.05V12Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">PROSTATE</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Prostate Health\u2122</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">14 well-researched ingredients including saw palmetto, resveratrol and EGCG for prostate health and function.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Saw Palmetto</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Resveratrol</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M15.36 5.21A14.92 14.92 0 0 0 14 4.5a8.27 8.27 0 0 1-1.74 4.42 8.27 8.27 0 0 0-1.51 5.34A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 7.5 9.5a8.27 8.27 0 0 1-3 6.36A8.25 8.25 0 1 0 17.5 9.18a8.49 8.49 0 0 1-2.14-3.97Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">TESTOSTERONE</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">ANDRO BENEFITS\u2122</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Purified shilajit, proprietary maca blend and deer antler velvet to support normal testosterone and hormonal balance.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Shilajit</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Maca</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Velvet</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M8.59 12.41a6 6 0 0 1 8.49-8.49l-1.06 1.06m-4.94 11.42L8.59 12.41m6.36 6.36-3.32-3.32m-1.4-1.4a6 6 0 0 0-3.74 1.43A6 6 0 0 0 4 21l1.5-1.5m11.13-11.13L21 4\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">PROSTATE</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Saw Palmetto</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Herbal extract from this evergreen palm supports prostate function and hair health in men.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Saw Palmetto</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M21 8.25c0-2.49-2.02-4.5-4.5-4.5-1.83 0-3.4 1.09-4.13 2.66A4.49 4.49 0 0 0 7.5 3.75 4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3 8.25c0 6.97 9 12 9 12s9-5.03 9-12Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">VITALITY</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Libido</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Clinically researched herbal extracts to promote healthy sexual drive, pleasure and function for men and women.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Botanicals</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Vitality</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M12 3v17.25m0 0a47.78 47.78 0 0 1 3.83.15M12 20.25a47.78 47.78 0 0 0-3.83.15M9.16 8.34h5.66c1.04 0 2 .49 2.62 1.33L21 14.25H3l3.55-4.58a3.31 3.31 0 0 1 2.62-1.33ZM12 8.25c0-2.07-1.7-3.75-3.75-3.75m11.25 3.75c0-2.07-1.7-3.75-3.75-3.75\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">HORMONAL</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">BioDIM\u00ae Complex</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Proprietary form of DIM with HMRlignan\u2122 and key antioxidants to support hormonal balance.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">DIM</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">HMRlignan</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M9.81 4.94 9 2.25l-.81 2.69a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 3L2.5 8.75l2.69.81a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 3 3l.81 2.69.81-2.69a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 3-3l2.69-.81-2.69-.81a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-3ZM18 7.5l-.51 1.71a3 3 0 0 1-2.03 2.03L13.75 11.75l1.71.51a3 3 0 0 1 2.03 2.03L18 16l.51-1.71a3 3 0 0 1 2.03-2.03L22.25 11.75l-1.71-.51a3 3 0 0 1-2.03-2.03L18 7.5ZM16.5 18.75 16.04 20l-.46 1.25-.46-1.25-.46-1.25.46-1.25.46 1.25Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">HAIR</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Hair Effects\u2122</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Saw palmetto, MSM, biotin and amino acids to support hair growth, follicle health and keratin production.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Biotin</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">MSM</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Saw Palmetto</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M21 8.25c0-2.49-2.02-4.5-4.5-4.5-1.83 0-3.4 1.09-4.13 2.66A4.49 4.49 0 0 0 7.5 3.75 4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3 8.25c0 6.97 9 12 9 12s9-5.03 9-12Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">CARDIO</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Cardio Benefits\u2122</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Heart formula combining CoQ10, L-carnitine and vitamins D3, K2 and B6 to support cardiovascular health.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">CoQ10</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">L-Carnitine</span></div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216207762561,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #012638; color: white; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center;\">\n    <div><img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_HeroBackground_2.jpg\" alt=\"Men's Health supplements\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px;\"/></div><div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">WHY DAVINCI FOR MEN'S HEALTH</p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 20px;\">Built for men, formulated by doctors, ready to brand.</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; opacity: .9; margin: 0;\">Customers want supplement brands that take them seriously. Our doctor-formulated men's line uses clinical-grade ingredients at therapeutic doses, with no filler and no marketing fluff. Bring credibility plus straight-talk marketing and customers will stay loyal for years.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
